Package: meegrid-n9
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: user/utilities
Priority: optional
Maintainer: smyhu <smyhu@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python (>= 2.6), python-pyside.qtdeclarative, python-pyside.qtgui, python-dbus, qt-components
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/smyhu/meegrid-n9
Description: MeeGrid - backup and restore of the home screen icon layout
 Saves the positions of the icons, the folders and the quick launch bar of
 the Nokia N9 home screen to MyDocs/MeeGrid and puts them back after a
 reflash or when the layout gets scrambled. Shows which apps from a backup
 are not installed yet. Optional automatic daily backup. Languages: en, pl.
 Designed and written by Claude (Anthropic) together with smyhu.
